SCOPE

This licence covers the code, the papers and the documentation in this
repository -- everything the author wrote.

It does NOT cover the contents of data/.  Those files are third-party
end-of-day exports from Investing.com, redistributed here so that the results
can be reproduced exactly, and they remain subject to that provider's own
terms.  They are not the author's to license.  Anyone wanting the series for
another purpose should obtain them from the provider or from the exchange.
